This is **Adaptive DTL**, a special-education discrete-trial learning app (Vite + React + TypeScript in `src/`, optional Node backend in `server/`).

Before editing, read **AGENTS.md** (full rules) and **CLAUDE.md** (short map). Do not invent architecture that contradicts those files or the READMEs.

**Student data:** never put real student PII in samples, commits, docs, prompts, or agent files. Prefer fictional placeholders. If a name is required, first name + last initial only. Keep realtime snapshots PII-free. Never commit `.env`, API keys, or `server/data/`.
